## 🚀 Quickstart

This project is built with [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) and [just](https://github.com/casey/just).

```bash
# 1. Install all dependencies
just setup

# 2. Start Jupyter Lab
just lab

# 3. Run all tests and linters
just lint
just test
```

## 📂 Structure

- `src/{{ python_module_name }}/` - Main Python source code
- `notebooks/` - Jupyter notebooks for exploration
- `tests/` - Pytest suite
{% if include_external_data %}- `.env` - Local environment variables (paths to external data)
{% endif %}
## 🗄️ Workspace (Generated Data)

{% if workspace_is_internal %}
Intermediate data (Parquet, DuckDB, plots) is stored in **`_workspace/`** inside this
repository. This directory is gitignored — it is never committed and is fully regenerable.

```
_workspace/
├── output/
│   ├── figures/   ← Generated plots (PNG, PDF)
│   └── tables/    ← Generated LaTeX tables
└── ...           ← Parquet, DuckDB intermediate files
```

To wipe and rebuild:

```bash
just clean-workspace
just pipeline-all  # or equivalent
```
{% else %}
Intermediate data (Parquet, DuckDB, plots) is stored **outside the repo** at the path
configured as `WORKSPACE_ROOT` in your `.env` file.

```bash
# Verify your environment is configured correctly
just check-env

# Wipe and rebuild the workspace
just clean-workspace
just pipeline-all  # or equivalent
```
{% endif %}
